      "text": "[9:27PM] #Maryland_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nVehicular movement from Anthony inward Maryland intersection enroute Odo'yalaro and Mobolaji Bank Anthony inward and outward is looking good.\n\nGood movement along Oba Akran Road, Kodesoh Road, Local Airport Road, Oba Akinjobi Way, Ikeja GRA likewise Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way inward and outward.\n\nOba Akran link bridge and Local Airport link bridge is Traffic free.\n\nOfficer are on ground doing the needful.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
