      "text": "[9:42PM] #Ikorodu #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood vehicular movement from Benson toward Ikorodu Interchange.\nTraffic is flowing smoothly from Sabo Roundabout through LASTMA Yard, First Gate, Jendol, and up to Odonguyan.\nThe corridor from Ikorodu Interchange to Ojubode, Oba Ayangburen’s Palace, and Ojogbe is also calm.\nReturn journey from Ojubode connecting Ladega, Onishigida, Itunpate, Itunmeko to Ota-Ona axis is completely free.\nObafemi Awolowo Road remains clear and calm with no obstructions reported.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
